00:38:44,263 --> 00:38:54,763
Dan melebur menjadi satu warna yang bermakna
Melting together into a single meaningful color

388
00:39:17,963 --> 00:39:19,563
Stop right there!

389
00:39:19,563 --> 00:39:24,263
