394
00:40:32,104 --> 00:40:37,304
ひらひら 葉落月
Fluttering leaf-fall moon,

395
00:40:37,904 --> 00:40:43,304
夜明けが見たいって 叫んだ空
the sky cried out that it wanted to see the dawn.

396
00:40:52,304 --> 00:40:53,904
暗く暗く陰と影の死の夜も
Even in the dark, dark night of shade and shadow death,

397
00:40:53,904 --> 00:40:55,404
深く深く耐えて芽差す地の慈よ
enduring deeply, the grace of the earth sprouts forth.

398
00:40:55,404 --> 00:40:56,904
来たる光照らす新世の世に
Into the new world illuminated by the coming light,

399
00:40:56,904 --> 00:40:58,704
高く高く舞え ヒバリ
soar high, high up, skylark!

400
00:41:12,604 --> 00:41:16,304
神様気取りのマダム達が 世界をA.I.して壊しました
Madams playing God loved the world with AI and destroyed it.

